OL,3,GNEWSAFirst tree planted for new
OL,4,Anational forest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first tree has been planted as part
OL,7,Fof the second new national forest being
OL,8,Fdeveloped in England.
OL,10,FThe forest will span 700 sq miles
OL,11,Fincluding around Milton Keynes,
OL,12,FBedford, Huntingdon and Cambourne along
OL,13,Fthe twin corridors of the River Great
OL,14,FOuse and the East-West Rail route.
OL,16,FEnvironment Secretary Dame Angela Eagle
OL,17,Fand Nature Minister Jenny
OL,18,FRiddell-Carpenter were in Central
OL,19,FBedfordshire to plant the tree.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
